WEBVTT

00:32.689 --> 00:34.010
Two minutes left.

00:34.400 --> 00:35.770
Second Sword:

00:37.350 --> 00:38.890
Demon-Dweller!

00:53.180 --> 00:54.780
Demon-Destroyer!

00:57.290 --> 00:59.980
What is this boy?

01:01.890 --> 01:05.379
I was the weakest devil in
the first level of the Underworld,

01:05.379 --> 01:09.340
and those Supreme Devils were
beings I could never hope to defeat...

01:09.940 --> 01:13.340
You have to live, Liebe...

01:14.260 --> 01:17.140
My beloved son...

01:17.140 --> 01:20.890
It's thanks to you that I've
managed to fight up until now!

01:20.890 --> 01:23.400
So thank you so much!

01:24.690 --> 01:27.030
That's my line, you moron.

01:27.030 --> 01:29.840
Thanks to you, I can fight
these Supreme Devils!

01:30.530 --> 01:33.410
What is this boy?!

01:33.410 --> 01:36.080
How can there be someone
whose attacks can work on me,

01:36.080 --> 01:39.910
but my attacks don't work on him?!

01:39.910 --> 01:45.170
All life exists for my entertainment.

01:45.860 --> 01:47.060
And yet...

01:48.770 --> 01:51.670
This is no longer fun...

01:52.060 --> 01:54.690
Who the hell are you?!

01:57.390 --> 02:00.430
What is this feeling...?!

02:00.430 --> 02:04.440
You don't need to know,
and there's no reason to.

02:04.440 --> 02:08.300
You're the Supreme Devils from
the first level of the Underworld.

02:08.940 --> 02:14.200
No one was a threat to you,
so of course you can't understand.

02:14.200 --> 02:16.530
It's called fear!

02:22.820 --> 02:25.040
Get back here, you jerk!

02:25.540 --> 02:30.050
It's likely that he can't stay
in that state for much longer.

02:30.050 --> 02:32.550
If I can stay away until then, I can win!

02:32.550 --> 02:34.300
Dammit! It's fast!

02:34.300 --> 02:36.640
This is bad. I can't catch up!

02:39.390 --> 02:42.800
I'll tear you apart and kill you!

02:42.800 --> 02:47.420
Your companions too!
And every human in this world!

02:47.420 --> 02:49.540
I won't allow that!

02:50.190 --> 02:52.940
I'll hold you even for a moment!

02:54.180 --> 02:57.440
What irony, Supreme Devil.

02:57.440 --> 03:01.040
You have immense magic power,
and what you fear...

03:06.540 --> 03:08.630
Keep your dirty hands...

03:09.130 --> 03:11.540
...off this world!

03:23.420 --> 03:26.190
...are a human and a devil
who have no magic.

03:49.250 --> 03:53.000
PAGE 175: THE HIGHEST VS THE LOWEST

03:55.660 --> 03:57.010
Devil Union...

03:57.540 --> 04:00.510
It looks like you haven't
fully completed it yet, but...

04:01.280 --> 04:03.510
Good job, you moron.

04:05.340 --> 04:09.650
I knew it. You really are a lot like
Captain Yami, Vice Captain Nacht.

04:11.020 --> 04:14.030
Who is a lot like whom?

04:14.030 --> 04:17.490
What are you doing to me?!

04:18.899 --> 04:23.570
When I look at him, it reminds me
of myself back then...

04:24.260 --> 04:27.040
Ow, ow, ow! It's happening again!

04:27.040 --> 04:29.840
The extreme full-body pain from
the kickback of Devil Union!

04:29.840 --> 04:33.840
I can't use Devil Union for the next
30 minutes or Black Mode either!

04:34.530 --> 04:37.090
- Owwww!
- 30 minutes, huh?

04:37.500 --> 04:42.370
The Dark Triad has gained
the power of the Supreme Devil.

04:42.370 --> 04:45.100
I doubt the others will be able
to hold out for 30 minutes.

04:45.490 --> 04:49.100
Morris, who's accelerating the opening
of the Underworld's gates, is also a problem.

04:49.520 --> 04:55.110
But above all else, we must defeat
the Dark Triad before the next gate opens.

04:55.110 --> 04:56.080
Ow, ow, ow!

04:56.080 --> 04:59.610
Even without Devil Union,
anti-magic should still be useful.

05:01.040 --> 05:04.660
The one in the most danger right now is...

05:18.220 --> 05:23.970
It seems your magic can change its
properties to match your opponent's magic.

05:23.970 --> 05:29.230
But my Body Magic has surpassed even that.

05:29.780 --> 05:33.150
I'm impressed you managed to last this long.

05:33.150 --> 05:34.980
But you're at your limit now...

05:34.980 --> 05:40.240
Shut the hell up!
I'm gonna... slash you!

05:41.220 --> 05:43.700
As a reward for entertaining me,

05:44.290 --> 05:46.240
I'll give you a spectacular death.

05:50.160 --> 05:52.920
Exploding Fireball!

06:12.480 --> 06:14.810
Yo, Chief.

06:17.170 --> 06:19.320
Who are these people?

06:21.550 --> 06:23.170
They're so weak.

06:23.920 --> 06:27.240
This isn't a place for weaklings like you.

06:27.240 --> 06:30.620
Aren't these guys Yami's peasants?!

06:30.990 --> 06:34.370
What are you doing here?!
Get the hell out of here!

06:34.370 --> 06:39.150
- Exactly. There's nothing you can do—
- We're here to defeat you

06:39.150 --> 06:41.700
and rescue Captain Yami.

06:41.700 --> 06:46.510
Even if their magic power is lower than mine,
there are still people who can entertain me.

06:46.510 --> 06:48.820
Like him, for example.

06:48.820 --> 06:52.270
But your magic power is far too weak.

06:53.010 --> 06:58.420
From what I can tell, neither of you has
anti-magic nor unique Arcane Stage magic.

06:58.420 --> 07:01.660
- Even if you both fight me at once, it'll—
- Don't get the wrong idea.

07:02.880 --> 07:05.360
I'm taking you down by myself!

07:14.540 --> 07:17.300
That's enough of your delusions!

07:18.180 --> 07:19.380
I know...

07:19.810 --> 07:23.630
I'm telling you that you aren't
even worthy of fighting me!

07:24.110 --> 07:26.080
I know that...

07:26.620 --> 07:28.530
I know you're strong...

07:30.850 --> 07:33.600
Captain Yami!

07:34.110 --> 07:36.610
That spell isn't complete yet!

07:36.610 --> 07:39.150
If you go out there now,
you won't be any help!

07:39.150 --> 07:41.900
You'll just die or get in the way!

07:51.540 --> 07:53.330
And I know...

07:54.510 --> 07:56.750
...that I'm weak!

08:00.900 --> 08:06.300
But I can't just go back to them
and pretend that it doesn't bother me!

08:08.190 --> 08:13.220
I have no intention of using
any of my magic on trash like you.

08:13.650 --> 08:16.230
Attack me all you want.

08:16.230 --> 08:19.570
Once you've had your fill, get lost!

08:20.190 --> 08:21.650
Is that so?

08:21.650 --> 08:23.970
Then I'll take you up on that!

08:26.900 --> 08:28.500
What the hell are you...

08:29.980 --> 08:32.159
And? So what?

08:39.919 --> 08:41.169
A chain?

08:42.130 --> 08:43.380
What is this?

08:54.310 --> 08:56.900
What?! My 100% power has worn off?!

08:56.900 --> 08:59.060
Huh? This is half?

08:59.060 --> 09:01.460
That's seriously insane.

09:01.460 --> 09:04.820
It's the magic power that a peasant
like me could never squeeze out.

09:05.300 --> 09:08.240
That's why I came up with this spell!

09:10.950 --> 09:12.570
Secret Flame Magic:

09:14.160 --> 09:16.290
Soul Chain Death Match!

09:16.780 --> 09:19.790
I didn't even faze on his attack before...
But now...?!

09:22.120 --> 09:26.050
I combined our magic power
and split it equally between us.

09:26.050 --> 09:31.090
This is the way I've come up with
to fight the strongest opponents!

09:31.760 --> 09:34.760
Peasant or not...

09:34.760 --> 09:38.940
I'll be the one to take you down!

09:38.940 --> 09:42.100
Magna Swing of the Black Bulls!

09:44.960 --> 09:48.230
Please! Teach me how to fight like you!

09:48.690 --> 09:50.060
SIX MONTHS AGO
In the Heart Kingdom,

09:50.060 --> 09:51.730
SIX MONTHS AGO
they told me my magic power was too low,

09:51.730 --> 09:55.140
and I couldn't use Mana Method to fight!

09:55.140 --> 10:00.250
But even though you're a peasant like me,
you somehow managed to make it work!

10:00.250 --> 10:03.600
Especially that spell that reflects attacks!
That was awesome!

10:03.600 --> 10:05.880
You can fight even with low magic power!

10:05.880 --> 10:09.710
Please! That darn Luck
is getting even stronger!

10:09.710 --> 10:13.720
I can't let him get ahead of me!

10:14.980 --> 10:19.810
And I can't keep being
a burden to the Black Bulls!

10:21.430 --> 10:25.690
A peasant Magic Knight who
uses Flame Magic, huh?

10:26.100 --> 10:30.440
I don't wanna watch you grovelling like that.
I'll teach you, so just cut it out.

10:30.440 --> 10:31.860
Really?!

10:32.930 --> 10:34.580
Follow me.

10:34.580 --> 10:35.500
Yes!

10:36.200 --> 10:39.470
We might discover something new
by working together anyway.

10:47.940 --> 10:49.460
What is this place...?

10:51.280 --> 10:53.380
It's my secret base.

10:53.920 --> 10:58.300
I've been searching for my own way
to become the strongest, too.

10:59.150 --> 11:03.930
As you might have guessed,
I also use that Mana Method thing.

11:04.400 --> 11:05.710
From what I hear,

11:05.710 --> 11:10.670
the Heart Kingdom creates Mana Method
on the fly and uses it in battle.

11:11.210 --> 11:15.680
That kind of fighting requires a lot of magic
power, good instincts, and fast reflexes.

11:16.610 --> 11:22.470
I'm a peasant, so all I can do is to prepare
my arrays together slowly beforehand.

11:22.470 --> 11:26.380
Especially for the powerful ones
like those counter-trap spells.

11:26.960 --> 11:29.420
But this method has its
advantages for us peasants.

11:30.130 --> 11:32.740
Runes we created with our weak magic power

11:32.740 --> 11:36.180
are so puny they just stick around.

11:37.140 --> 11:42.180
That allows us to spend a long time
building incredibly complex arrays.

11:42.850 --> 11:47.850
But to do that, we need to learn
more about mana and ourselves.

11:48.670 --> 11:52.860
What you need is studying
and steady, painstaking effort.

11:55.190 --> 11:58.740
Can someone as stupid and
short-tempered as you do that?

11:59.360 --> 12:02.350
I've always used spells on instinct...

12:02.350 --> 12:07.410
But the more I learn about mana,
the more there is to know!

12:08.460 --> 12:11.140
There's even compatibility between
mana and magic attributes...

12:11.140 --> 12:13.620
I don't think I can pull off
that counter-trap spell.

12:13.620 --> 12:17.680
How do I beat someone with
ridiculously huge magic power?

12:19.920 --> 12:24.660
If only I had that much magic power
myself, I'd win on sheer grit, but...!

12:25.680 --> 12:27.140
Brother Zora!

12:28.000 --> 12:29.250
Who's "your brother"?

12:29.250 --> 12:31.660
What do you think of this array?

12:34.570 --> 12:38.900
I never even considered it before.
But it might not be impossible.

12:38.900 --> 12:40.880
Now that's interesting.

12:42.660 --> 12:46.660
Though it'll take a ludicrous amount
of time and patience to create.

12:59.760 --> 13:02.970
I was able to create this because
I spent half a year preparing for it!

13:02.970 --> 13:05.990
A one-time-only spell that's mine alone!

13:06.520 --> 13:10.770
Secret Flame Magic: Soul Chain Death Match!

13:10.770 --> 13:13.860
C'mon, it's not that complicated.

13:14.350 --> 13:19.360
I just linked us up and divided
our magic power equally.

13:19.360 --> 13:21.660
But let me give you a heads-up.

13:21.660 --> 13:25.870
That chain is our very souls.

13:25.870 --> 13:31.370
If you try to forcibly remove or break it,
you'll go insane. So be careful.

13:32.060 --> 13:35.730
Impossible...
A peasant created a spell like that...?

13:35.730 --> 13:38.380
Well, it turned out to be possible.

13:38.380 --> 13:42.190
Outside attacks would
interfere with the spell's effects,

13:42.190 --> 13:44.640
so just watch, all right?

13:44.640 --> 13:47.890
This is his fight.

13:52.390 --> 13:56.100
Gravity Magic: Heavy Infighting!

14:00.320 --> 14:05.950
Didn't you say I could attack you
as much as I wanted, Chief?!

14:05.950 --> 14:09.750
Shut up, you filthy thief!

14:10.830 --> 14:13.580
Gravity Magic: Presence of the Demon King!

14:14.740 --> 14:18.090
We have the same amount of magic power now!

14:18.090 --> 14:21.010
I can buckle down and take this!

14:31.280 --> 14:32.800
No matter

14:34.650 --> 14:36.860
what you do,

14:36.860 --> 14:41.360
as long as I can regenerate
with my Body Magic,

14:42.190 --> 14:46.870
you'll never be able to defeat me!

14:47.520 --> 14:53.330
You'll regret defying someone
above your station!

14:53.920 --> 14:56.290
Now get on your knees!

14:58.210 --> 15:02.800
You may be forced to your knees...
But you kept struggling, desperately trying

15:03.220 --> 15:06.970
to make that tiny flame inside you burn,
and kept preparing right up until today.

15:07.970 --> 15:10.470
It doesn't matter if your
opponent's the enemy's boss,

15:11.310 --> 15:14.350
a devil host, or even immortal...

15:15.850 --> 15:16.850
Win this!

15:19.480 --> 15:20.320
Magna!

15:26.860 --> 15:28.370
This magic power...

15:32.640 --> 15:34.700
How dare you...

15:35.220 --> 15:39.950
You punched me in the face
and put my back on the ground!

15:56.350 --> 15:58.260
Goddamit...!

16:00.900 --> 16:04.480
Even if you use that cheap spell
to steal half my magic power

16:04.480 --> 16:07.610
and we trade blows with equal strength,

16:07.610 --> 16:12.530
you'll still take damage
while I keep regenerating!

16:12.960 --> 16:16.290
Our original specs are completely
different from the start!

16:16.290 --> 16:18.500
You're not the one!

16:18.500 --> 16:24.820
A worthless creature like you will never be
the one to give me the ultimate pleasure!

16:26.800 --> 16:29.050
Yeah, he's right.

16:30.380 --> 16:32.740
I'm just a peasant.

16:33.300 --> 16:37.100
I wasn't born into some
powerful noble or royal family.

16:37.730 --> 16:42.230
I'm not Luck, a commoner
with incredible instincts,

16:42.230 --> 16:47.240
nor am I Asta, a peasant with
something as insane as anti-magic.

16:49.900 --> 16:51.820
I'm just...

16:52.530 --> 16:55.370
Did you enjoy your time in the Heart Kingdom?

16:56.660 --> 17:01.420
Y-Yeah. Um... Mister Yami, why did you...

17:02.700 --> 17:06.099
Why did you let me join your brigade?

17:08.859 --> 17:11.520
I guess we had similar tastes?

17:12.160 --> 17:14.339
I-Is that so?

17:14.859 --> 17:16.060
Also,

17:18.980 --> 17:22.060
you seemed like the one with the most guts.

17:26.339 --> 17:27.980
I...

17:30.420 --> 17:32.160
I...!

17:33.260 --> 17:36.740
I'll never lose to anyone
when it comes to guts!

18:03.310 --> 18:08.280
This is a fighting style I came up with
and trained for through sheer determination!

18:08.280 --> 18:16.030
You have no right to complain about it!

18:54.030 --> 18:59.030
I'm gonna blow you into pieces, you loser!

19:06.880 --> 19:08.540
Well, nice try.

19:09.220 --> 19:10.900
You get it now?

19:11.300 --> 19:14.940
This is the cruel and unfair reality.

19:14.940 --> 19:18.720
No matter how much someone
inferior like you struggles,

19:18.720 --> 19:23.310
it's all pointless!

19:29.180 --> 19:30.020
What?

19:30.960 --> 19:33.410
The devil's power has
completely disappeared?!

19:33.410 --> 19:35.740
No, this is...

19:36.160 --> 19:39.120
You punk! What did you do?!

19:41.240 --> 19:44.220
Not a thing, you moron.

19:44.220 --> 19:47.500
Both you and I have simply
run out of magic power!

19:49.250 --> 19:55.330
A monster like you never experienced
running out of magic power, right?

19:55.330 --> 19:59.100
You've never fought anybody
who has as much magic as you do,

19:59.100 --> 20:04.220
so you didn't even realize how much
magic power you were using up!

20:05.060 --> 20:09.980
My own magic power ran out and
cut off my connection with Lucifero...!

20:10.590 --> 20:14.730
Even my Gravity Magic or
Body Magic's Super Regeneration...!

20:14.730 --> 20:18.490
Now you can't use any decent spells!

20:18.490 --> 20:21.620
But neither can yo—

20:34.630 --> 20:36.590
I can't possibly lose!

20:37.010 --> 20:40.260
Not me! I cannot lose...

20:41.390 --> 20:44.010
...to a nobody like you!

20:47.390 --> 20:49.230
Finish him!

21:00.030 --> 21:03.030
There's no way I lose to a nobody like—

21:03.030 --> 21:07.790
Shut the hell up, you psycho!

22:07.390 --> 22:10.370
You won that one, Magna.

22:11.200 --> 22:14.020
Thanks, Brother Zora.

22:14.430 --> 22:16.310
Like I said, I'm not you brother.
